%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Route  as Next.js API Route
    participant Svc    as CMS Service
    participant DB     as Supabase
    participant WP     as WordPress REST v2
    participant SH     as Shopify Admin API

    Route->>DB: decrypt_cms_credentials(cmsConnectionId)<br/>via service-role RPC (never client-side)
    DB-->>Route: decrypted credentials (in-memory only)

    Route->>DB: INSERT publish_jobs (status=pending, idempotency_key)
    DB-->>Route: job.id

    Route->>Svc: draftToCanonical(draft, options)
    Svc-->>Route: CanonicalPublishPayload

    alt WordPress target
        Route->>Svc: canonicalToWordPress(payload, { categoryIds, tagIds })
        Svc-->>Route: WordPressPostCreate
        Route->>WP: POST /wp/v2/posts (Basic auth — App Password)
        WP-->>Route: { id, link, status }
    else Shopify target
        Route->>Svc: canonicalToShopify(payload, { blogId, author })
        Svc-->>Route: ShopifyArticleCreate
        Route->>SH: POST /admin/api/2025-01/blogs/:id/articles.json<br/>(X-Shopify-Access-Token)
        SH-->>Route: { article: { id, handle, published_at } }
    end

    Route->>DB: UPDATE publish_jobs<br/>(status=published, externalUrl, completedAt)
    DB-->>Route: ok

    Note over Route,DB: On any failure: UPDATE publish_jobs (status=failed, attempts+1)<br/>Retry up to 3× with idempotency_key ensuring no duplicate posts
